      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bryn_Mawr%2C_Minneapolis"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The neighborhood sits between Theodore Wirth Park, Bassett Creek, and Bryn Mawr Meadows, giving it a quiet, green character.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bryn_Mawr%2C_Minneapolis"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Brownie Lake, the northernmost of Minneapolis’s Chain of Lakes, lies within Bryn Mawr and is surrounded by a 18‑acre park.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bryn_Mawr%2C_Minneapolis"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Bryn Mawr hosts an annual Garage Sale Festival that began in the 1970s and now features over 100 sales plus food and drink.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
